# The project's own settings of the reference, which Doxyfile includes at its end: Doxyfile is
# the template's and `copier update` brings it up to date, this file is the project's and the
# update leaves it alone. += adds to a list of Doxyfile, = replaces a setting:
#
#   INPUT                  += docs/Wiring.md
#   IMAGE_PATH             = docs
#   PREDEFINED             += PREFIX_CHECK_ACCESS=1

# The pages of docu/, which the README links, and their pictures.
INPUT                  += docu/README.md
IMAGE_PATH             = docu
# The reports of MAXMATRIX_DEV_ERROR_DETECT are API as well: MaxMatrixReportError() and what a
# sketch sees of them exist only with the switch on.
PREDEFINED             += MAXMATRIX_DEV_ERROR_DETECT=1u
